<item>
            <title>[BOOKKEEPER-1021] Improve the merge script to handle github reviews api</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/BOOKKEEPER-1021</link>
                <project id="12311293" key="BOOKKEEPER">Bookkeeper</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Current script doesn&apos;t handle the new reviews API. &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;We need to improve the merge script to handle the new review API.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://developer.github.com/v3/pulls/reviews/&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://developer.github.com/v3/pulls/reviews/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;We can do similar thing like what DistributedLog is doing.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/incubator-distributedlog/blob/master/scripts/dev/dl-merge-pr.py&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/incubator-distributedlog/blob/master/scripts/dev/dl-merge-pr.py&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
